            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This outcome evaluation study has investigated different diet concepts in day-care centres and their effects on health-related dietary behaviour of children and their families. No advantage of a certain approach to manage food and diet-related activities in day-care centres could be shown.</AbstractText>
